            <div id="product-description-short-98176" itemprop="description"><p>Collect luminous clear art cards featuring balloon-themed illustrations in the <strong>Puella Magi Madoka Magica Memorial Clear Card Collection 6-Pack BOX [Movic]</strong>!</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>JAN Code:</strong> 4550621691898</li>
<li><strong>Maker / Publisher:</strong> Movic</li>
<li><strong>Anime Series:</strong> Puella Magi Madoka Magica</li>
<li><strong>Product Type:</strong> Memorial Clear Card Collection Box</li>
<li><strong>Card Dimensions:</strong> Approx. 9 cm x 5.5 cm</li>
<li><strong>Set Contents:</strong> 1 BOX = 6 Packs (2 Cards per Pack / 12 Designs Total)</li>
<li><strong>Materials:</strong> Polypropylene (PP)</li>
</ul></div>
          

          
          
