                <div class="tab-pane fade in active" id="description" role="tabpanel">
                  
                    <div class="product-description"><h2>Puella Magi Madoka Magica Memorial Clear Card Collection 6-Pack BOX [Movic]</h2>
<p>From the legendary magical girl anime series <em>Puella Magi Madoka Magica</em> comes an official trading clear card release by <strong>Movic</strong>!</p>
<p>This 6-pack box set features brand-new, original illustrations of the magical girls surrounded by colorful balloons, printed on high-quality transparent PP cards. Their beautiful translucent design allows you to overlap cards, layer them over backgrounds, or display them in card sleeves and phone cases for a truly memorable collector's piece!</p>
<h3>Product Highlights</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Exclusive New Artwork:</strong> Features newly drawn illustrations of Madoka and her friends surrounded by balloons.</li>
<li><strong>Translucent Clear Finish:</strong> Beautiful transparency lets light pass through, perfect for layering or backlighting displays.</li>
<li><strong>Compact Card Size:</strong> Measures approx. 9 x 5.5 cm, ideal for carrying in wallet slots, clear phone cases, or collector binders.</li>
<li><strong>Complete Pack Contents:</strong> Includes 2 clear cards per pack (12 total cards per box).</li>
</ul>
<h3>Product Specifications</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>JAN Code:</strong> 4550621691898</li>
<li><strong>Manufacturer / Maker:</strong> Movic</li>
<li><strong>Series:</strong> Puella Magi Madoka Magica</li>
<li><strong>Item Type:</strong> Trading Clear Card Collection Box</li>
<li><strong>Card Size:</strong> Approx. 9 cm x 5.5 cm</li>
<li><strong>Print Quality:</strong> Full-Color Print on Translucent PP</li>
<li><strong>Material:</strong> Polypropylene (PP)</li>
<li><strong>Box Quantity:</strong> 6 Packs per BOX (2 Cards per Pack / 12 Designs Total)</li>
<li><strong>Note:</strong> Contains random packs per box; purchasing one box may not guarantee a full complete set of 12 designs.</li>
<li><strong>Copyright:</strong> © Magica Quartet / Aniplex, Madoka Partners, MBS</li>
</ul>
<hr />
<p><strong>Hobby Genki Tip:</strong> Want to maximize your savings? Take advantage of our "Hobby Genki My Private Warehouse" service! You can secure and bundle multiple items over time, shipping them all together to drastically cut down on international shipping costs.</p></div>
                  
                </div>

                
